    "summary": "5d28d6c2: computeCodeReviewFreshness takes codeIndexWork(repoPath) and returns { isProcessing = inFlight || pending > 0, inFlight, pendingCodeIndexJobs, staleFiles (unchanged) }. The codeReview.freshness handler (src/daemon/index.ts) supplies queue.codeIndexWorkFor and returns the FreshnessResult itself as the reply, so no field can be dropped there. CodeReviewFreshnessResult and freshnessFromReply (src/shared/review-stream.ts) carry inFlight and pendingCodeIndexJobs, mapping an older reply to inFlight = isProcessing and 0; both clients use it (daemon-client.ts unchanged; mcp/daemon-stream.ts types its reply from it). Four falsifying mutations each fail a test. tsc clean; workflow, daemon, daemon/steps, MCP and shared suites 2606 pass, only the pre-existing review-decision failure.",
